## What's changed in this PR:  

1. We allow cudagraph logic to be orthogonal to VLLM compilation in v1. In other words, full cudagraph without compilation is supported in v1 now;  
2. Full cudagraph support for Flash Attention v2 and FlashInfer (moved to [#21367](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/21367) with further optimizations);
